{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>準備經香園圍或蓮塘口岸北上時，面對繁複的泊車預約往往令人頭痛。這款 App 讓用戶只需選擇入場及離場時間，即可一目瞭然地查看整段泊車期間的最少尚餘車位、預估費用及所需時長，免去逐個半小時手動查詢的麻煩，是跨境駕駛者規劃行程的實用工具。</p>\n\n<h2>四類車位智能比較</h2>\n<p>支援比較私家車、傷殘人士專用、電單車及客貨車四種車位類型，並按每個半小時時段詳細顯示可預約情況。查詢完成後，用戶可直接連結至停車場官方網站進行正式預約，實現從資訊檢索到實際預訂的無縫銜接。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-109-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-110-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-111-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-112-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-113-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：香園圍泊車配額</li>\n<li>應用類別：Travel</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-08T14:15:09.688457+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":261,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}